		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><strong>2 Actions (1 scrap):</strong> Requires a Firearm. Range 6, Blast 3, Damage STRd8 Cold. Targets must make a STR save. On a fail, they are Restrained; on a save, they are Slowed 1 round.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> The area remains for 1 minute, becoming Slowed Terrain.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Slowed you apply lasts +1 turn.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using the gadget spends 1 Toolbelt scrap — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls STRd8 Cold and the STR save: Restrained on a fail, Slowed on a save.</em></p><p><em>[A] The Toolbelt upgrade is the separate \"Endothermic Shell (Toolbelt)\" feature (2 scraps total); the passive lives on the \"Endothermic Shell\" gadget feature, so it works even if this item is unequipped.</em></p><p><em>[A] Keep the gadget equipped: Nimble switches off an unequipped object's rules, so its scrap cost would not be charged.</em></p><p><em>[M] Slowed lasts 1 round.</em></p>",
